  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e27cbac7786250d42af7ca2bf4d1c9a5, type: 3}
  m_Name: MarkBeesly_Log04
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LogData
  subject: Asteroid hit the ship. Starboard side wing.
  log: IV
  date: June 7th, 20XX
  author: Mark Beesly
  message: "Unknown number of casualties. Acquired filter helmet. I thought the boiler
    room would be safe, but after an hour of breathing in the asteroid particles,
    two of my coworkers began losing consciousness and their grip on reality. Their
    skin is turning pale green. Radio\u2019d status to manager. No response. I am
    beginning to fear for my life."
